# Children of the Rune (adoulin 119): the script's reward attempt follows every one of Octavien's event finishes, whatever
# the csid. A GM's RUN_COTR 3 set while the standard dialog (27) is open: its finish gives the reward and completes the
# quest; set again after it, the Completed talk (28) finishes into the attempt too (the claymore held, rare: not given).
char zone=EasternAdoulin pos=2.444,-11.439,-16.595 job=WHM lvl=30
setting ADVANCED_JOB_LEVEL 31
login
trigger Octavien                # below the gate: 27
charvar RUN_COTR 3              # a GM, with the event open
finish                          # the reward: completed
charvar RUN_COTR 3
trigger Octavien                # Completed first: 28
finish                          # the attempt: the claymore held, nothing
